abstract: >-
  Public reproducibility materials for statistical analysis of AI-governance
  institutional terrain across the United Nations and wider multilateral
  ecosystem, including a structured mixed-data Gower distance and principal
  coordinates analysis workflow plus a publication-style visualization.
